#: src/components/guide-modal.js:127
msgid "With the <icon/> button in the block toolbar you can set the Timeline range from a list of blocks. Note: The desired block must have a HTML anchor assigned, otherwise it will not be selectable. Alternatively, enter a <strong>custom CSS selector</strong> in the inspector panel."
